 ## Subtopics
 
 ### FisherRF
-The original method that uses the sum of color parameter variances for direction-dependent uncertainty. Regression-based FisherRF is a modification of this [S1, unofficial].
+The original method that sums all color parameter variances for direction-dependent uncertainty. It is the predecessor to this variant [S1, unofficial].
 
 ### PRIMU
-The primary method that uses a meta-regression model for uncertainty estimation. Regression-based FisherRF is designed to be comparable to PRIMU [S1, unofficial].
+The method that uses a meta-regression model for uncertainty estimation. Regression-based FisherRF is modified to align with PRIMU's pipeline for fair comparison [S1, unofficial].
 
